        "exam_year": "2019",
        "question_text": "<p><strong><em>Ka &agrave;won &agrave;yok&agrave; is&agrave;l&egrave; w&ograve;ny&iacute; k&iacute; o si d&aacute;h&ugrave;n &agrave;w\u1ecdn ib&eacute;&egrave;r&egrave; t&iacute; &oacute; t&egrave;l&eacute; okokan won.</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&Egrave;D&Egrave; &Agrave;K&Agrave;Y&Eacute;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&quot;&Eacute;k&oacute; d&aacute;ra! Ek&oacute; sunw&ograve;n!&quot;. Ariwo tioluko &agrave;won T&egrave;milad&eacute; m&aacute;a \u0144 pa f&uacute;n &agrave;w\u1ecdn ak&eacute;k&ograve;&oacute; r&egrave; niy&iacute; n&iacute; gbogbo igb&agrave;, &agrave;m&oacute; orin im&ograve;r&agrave;n yi&iacute; k&ograve; t&agrave; l&eacute;t&iacute; T&egrave;milad&eacute;. Seun, K&oacute;l&aacute;jo &agrave;ti K&uacute;nl&eacute; t&iacute; w&oacute;n j&eacute; k&ograve;r&iacute;-k&ograve;s\u016fn T&egrave;milad&eacute; ni w&oacute;n jo m&aacute;a \u0144 se iran&ugrave; kiri. A til&egrave; m&aacute;a f&oacute;nnu p&eacute; k&ograve; digb&agrave; t&iacute; &egrave;niy&agrave;n b&aacute; k&agrave;w&eacute; k&oacute; t&oacute; l&oacute;w&oacute; l&oacute;w&oacute;, b&eacute;&egrave; ow&oacute; l&ograve;un \u0144 f&eacute;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>L&aacute;ti fa or&ograve; g&ugrave;n, J&iacute;d&eacute; t&oacute; j&eacute; &egrave;gb&oacute;n r&egrave; k&agrave;w&eacute; j&aacute;de n&iacute; Yunif&aacute;siti, o s&igrave;nr&uacute; il&uacute;, &oacute; r&iacute;\u015f&eacute; gidi, &oacute; si b&egrave;r\u1ec7 s&iacute; &iacute; r&aacute;j&eacute; j\u0119un d&aacute;ad&aacute;a. Ow&oacute; r&egrave; yi&iacute; fej&uacute; m&oacute; T&egrave;milad&eacute; l&oacute; b&aacute; pa iw&eacute; k&iacute;k&agrave; t&igrave; p&eacute; &ograve;un f&eacute; s&ograve;w&ograve;. Egb&oacute;n &agrave;ti &agrave;w\u1ecdn &ograve;b&iacute; r&egrave; d&aacute; a l&oacute;k&ograve;w&ograve;, &agrave;m&oacute; k&ograve; t&oacute; od&uacute;n m&aacute;r&ugrave;n-&uacute;n, in&aacute; s\u1ecd n&iacute;l&eacute; itaj&agrave; r&egrave;, &oacute; s&igrave;.runm gbogbo oj&agrave; n\u1ea5&agrave;. B&aacute;yi ni Temilad&eacute; di edun arinl&egrave;. &Oacute; gbiy&agrave;nj&uacute; l&aacute;ti w&aacute;\u015f&eacute; p&egrave;l&uacute; iw&ograve;nba iw&eacute; t&oacute; k&agrave; \u015f&ugrave;gb&oacute;n ow&oacute; is&eacute;p&eacute; &agrave;ti i\u015f&eacute; &egrave;gbin ni w&oacute;n fi \u0144 l\u1ed9 &oacute;. Iw&aacute;j&uacute; &ograve; \u015fe &eacute; lo, &egrave;y&igrave;n &ograve; s&igrave; \u015fe &eacute; pad&agrave; s&iacute; f&uacute;n un; ojooj&uacute;m&oacute; l&oacute; si w&aacute; \u0144 k&aacute;b&agrave;&aacute;m\u1ed9&nbsp;p&eacute; oun k&ograve; k&agrave;w&eacute; yanj&uacute;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;\u0130b&eacute;&egrave;r&egrave;:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ta l&oacute; m&aacute;a \u0144 korin f&uacute;n &agrave;w\u1ecdn ak&eacute;k&ograve;&oacute; p&eacute; &nbsp;&egrave;k&oacute; d&aacute;ra?</p>",
